WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.600
In WhatsApp, long-press the photo
or document, tap ⋮ and Share.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.800
In the list of apps, choose Linkalia.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:22.800
Open the collection and the category
where you want to save it.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.800
Tap “Save here”.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.267
Done! It's now in your collection.

